From 82bb5385c685116fed40d6790a427553c349d106 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: callan <callanf@nvidia.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 18:41:06 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 30/38] feat(kvcr): kvcr.demote_whole_chain (off by default):
 kv.demote starts its tail walk at the end of the single-child chain G1 caches
 below the request's last block (the turn's output blocks), so a demote of a
 finished turn's prompt is no longer stopped at once by its own output blocks
 (43% of demotes dropped nothing for that reason); CachedChains keeps each
 block's last stored child. Probe AISIM_KV_PROBE prints one line per demote
 (walk length, blocks below, G1 and G2 residency, dropped, why it stopped);
 unit test

